===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ar}} {{Arab|[[حجب]]}} (''ħájaba'', 'to veil,' 'to cover,' 'to screen').

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/hɪˈdʒɑːb/}}, {{IPA|/hɪˈdʒæb/}}, {{IPA|/ˈhɪ.dʒæb/}}, or {{IPA|/hɛˈdʒɑːb/}}[http://oxforddictionaries.com/definition/hijab?q=hijab][http://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/hijab][http://dictionary.cambridge.org/dictionary/british/hijab][http://www.collinsdictionary.com/dictionary/english/hijab]
* {{rhymes|ɑːb}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|-}}

# {{uncountable}} {{Islam}} the [[practice]], when beyond the [[age]] of [[puberty]], of [[dressing]] [[modest]]ly (especially for [[women]]).
# {{countable}} the [[hajib]] [[headscarf]].

